<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss cantonal banks set 500 mln sfr domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss cantonal banks set 500 mln sfr domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new issue terms were fixed by the lead manager:</p>
<p>BORROWER - Pfandbriefzentrale of the Swiss Cantonal Banks</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Zurich Cantonal Bank</p>
<p> AMT   500 million CHF    COUPON    4-1/8	MATURITY   25.Nov.06</p>
<p> TYPE   str	     ISS PRICE 100-7/8    PAY DATE   25.Nov.96</p>
<p> LISTING 31.Oct.96    PAY FREQ --	    ACCRUAL    25.Nov.96</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
